      "message": "Add patient load to lumbar model and clean up spec docs\n\nWire the moved patient's weight into the lumbar compression model so\nW_upper = body_weight \u00d7 0.6 + patient_weight, matching the real\ncaregiving load during \u64fa\u4f4d/\u79fb\u5e8a tasks.\n\n- app.py: add \"\u8001\u4eba\u91cd\u91cf\" sidebar input, pass as load_kg to compute_all,\n  record it in subject_info\n- database.py: add patient_kg column with \u8001\u4eba\u91cd\u91cf(kg) label\n- Add regenerated biomechanics spec (IMU_exo_revised.docx) with corrected\n  formulas and embedded diagrams, plus generation scripts\n  (gen_rewrite.py, gen_figures.py) and figures (doc_imgs/)\n- Remove tracked LibreOffice lock files and runtime-generated\n  exo_records.xlsx; gitignore *.xlsx, lock files, and temp dumps\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
