      "message": "Re-verify all five validation checks pass, clean up spec.md \u00a711\n\nRe-ran all five required checks against the current spec (v1.3) and\nthe committed model.xlsx (recalculated fresh: 1,078 formulas, 0\nerrors) -- all five pass, matching the acceptance criteria exactly\n(Tomatoes 10/Carrots 20/Mesclun 30, $42,775 profit vs $42,762 target,\nstandalone crossovers 10/10/6).\n\nSection 11 previously carried an orphaned \"Round 1\" table showing the\nchecks failing under the pre-fix wage formula, with its \"Round 2\"\nresolution accidentally deleted in a direct edit -- leaving the spec\nlooking like it still failed even though sections 3-10 already had\nthe corrected formulas. Replaced with a single, current pass/fail\ntable plus a condensed history of how the wage-tier bug was found and\nfixed via the Farm Profit Lab, so the document reads consistently\ntop to bottom.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01JZmuQb8pWEf7KnjUL2U6fH",
