      "origin": "ZerNico/neema",
      "sha": "b932a058c0dc4850019bd6a489175c1ca55d4068",
      "message": "Keep spreadsheet formula errors when a summary is read back\n\nThe engine reports formula errors as `{ count }`, and the summary stores\nthe number. Reading a stored summary back through the same function looked\nfor `.count` on a number and dropped it, so a reloaded spreadsheet edit lost\nits formula error count while the live row showed it.\n\nAccept either shape, so the summary is the same whether it reads the\nengine's result, a stored row or a stream envelope.",
